### ─── Returns and cancellations — PMS-010 ────────────────────────────────────
### Covers `POST /api/returns` and `POST /api/sales/:id/cancel`.
###
### Quick start:
###   1. Start the API:  npm start
###   2. Open this file with the REST Client extension.
###   3. Run the login request, then walk through each scenario in order.

@host = http://localhost
@port = 3000
@base = {{host}}:{{port}}/api


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AUTH — log in as a pharmacist (returns) and an admin (cancellations)
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# @name loginPharmacist
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "pharmacist@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ── Login with admin ─────────────────────────────────────

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### ── Login with cashier ─────────────────────────────────────

# @name loginCashier
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "cashier@openpharmacy.com",
  "password": "password123"
}


### ── Store tokens for later requests ─────────────────────────────────────

@pharmToken = {{loginPharmacist.response.body.accessToken}}
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}
@cashierToken = {{loginCashier.response.body.accessToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 1. Look up the original sale (replace the id with one you got from POST
###    /api/sales or from the database seed). The response gives you the
###    `saleItems[]` needed for the return body below.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

GET {{base}}/sales/c54b44d5-21b0-4102-923f-115aa3942e56
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 2. PARTIAL RETURN — a pharmacist returns part of a sale.
###    Expect: 201, stock restored to the original lot, one RETURN movement
###    per affected lot, one RETURN_COMPLETED audit row.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "045e2de3-d745-4049-9b2b-d1baf658de3f",
  "reason": "Customer returned unopened product",
  "returnType": "PARTIAL",
  "items": [
    {
      "saleItemId": "bcefb5cb-a3a3-4cb0-95ce-7e5b8d401c57",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 3. FULL RETURN — every line item is refunded and the sale flips to
###    REFUNDED.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "c54b44d5-21b0-4102-923f-115aa3942e56",
  "reason": "Customer changed mind",
  "returnType": "FULL",
  "items": [
    {
      "saleItemId": "10acfeb4-2fd6-494a-a108-fb854dce3089",
      "quantity": 2
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 4. REJECTED — controlled substance (PSYCHOTROPIC or NARCOTIC).
###    Expect: 403 CONTROLLED_PRODUCT, no stock change, no return record.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "107abaa7-d5bf-4cb0-9187-1efcd4778208",
  "reason": "Customer return",
  "returnType": "PARTIAL",
  "items": [
    {
      "saleItemId": "b09d942b-e103-4938-a073-6bf85e9e0f3b",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 5. REJECTED — over-return (requesting more than the remaining refundable
###    quantity). Expect: 400 RETURN_QUANTITY_EXCEEDED.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "c7572ff8-fe83-4407-8256-72f276751087",
  "reason": "Mistake",
  "returnType": "PARTIAL",
  "items": [
    {
      "saleItemId": "b4a4e242-2eae-4acb-bd09-e8d916ec86d1",
      "quantity": 99
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 6. REJECTED — sale item does not belong to the supplied sale.
###    Expect: 400 RETURN_SALE_ITEM_MISMATCH.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{pharmToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "c7572ff8-fe83-4407-8256-72f276751087",
  "reason": "Wrong line",
  "returnType": "PARTIAL",
  "items": [
    {
      "saleItemId": "b4a4e242-2eae-4acb-bd09-e8d916ec86d1",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 7. REJECTED — cashier is not allowed to authorise a return.
###    Expect: 403 from the RolesGuard.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/returns
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "saleId": "46c3e44d-6dd1-4544-b1fa-7488507af7a0",
  "reason": "Cashier attempt",
  "returnType": "PARTIAL",
  "items": [
    {
      "saleItemId": "9e0f0e6b-9010-4bf1-aa56-f74436a8c89b",
      "quantity": 1
    }
  ]
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 8. CANCEL — admin cancels a completed sale. Every sold quantity goes
###    back to its original lot; the sale status flips to CANCELLED.
###    Expect: 200, one CANCELLATION movement per lot, one SALE_CANCELLED
###    audit row.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/sales/cec32634-4cb0-4a1b-96b4-d206b7108bbd/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Duplicate sale recorded"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 9. REJECTED — cancelling a sale that already has a return.
###    Expect: 409 SALE_HAS_RETURNS.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/sales/8bb5de67-2e2f-4bcf-a092-4f2fa616a5ac/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Trying again"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 10. REJECTED — cancelling an already-cancelled sale.
###     Expect: 409 SALE_ALREADY_CANCELLED.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/sales/89ab7ada-2cf5-4271-83c4-89c6b2f402b5/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Already cancelled"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 11. REJECTED — cancelling a controlled-substance sale.
###     Expect: 403 CONTROLLED_PRODUCT.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/sales/ba179cff-144a-4941-abf0-4359a8151879/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Operational correction"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 12. REJECTED — cashier is not allowed to authorise a cancellation.
###     Expect: 403 from the RolesGuard.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/sales/f8be09a2-541a-4938-b2e0-badde83d7e8a/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{cashierToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Cashier attempt"
}


### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### 13. REJECTED — missing reason.
###     Expect: 400 from ValidationPipe.
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

POST {{base}}/sales/f8be09a2-541a-4938-b2e0-badde83d7e8a/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
}
